---
---
<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-card">
      <div class="about-text-col">
        <div class="section-badge">
          <span>About</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="about-heading">
          Bridging design aesthetics and construction reality.
        </h2>

        <p class="about-p">
          I am an interior architect focused on creating refined residential and commercial environments. My work combines artistic mood and light simulation with the discipline of precise architectural drafting.
        </p>

        <p class="about-p">
          Whether delivering high-poly <strong>3ds Max + Corona</strong> photorealistic renderings for presentations or issuing complete <strong>AutoCAD</strong> technical drawing packages for on-site fabrication, my goal is seamless execution.
        </p>

        <div class="software-row">
          <span class="sw-tag">3ds Max</span>
          <span class="sw-tag">Corona Renderer</span>
          <span class="sw-tag">AutoCAD</span>
          <span class="sw-tag">V-Ray</span>
          <span class="sw-tag">Revit</span>
          <span class="sw-tag">Photoshop</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-visual-col">
        <div class="about-quote-box">
          <span class="quote-number">01</span>
          <p class="quote-text">
            “Clean details, natural materials, and accurate technical drawings are what separate a concept from a timeless built space.”
          </p>
          <div class="quote-author">
            <span class="author-name">Jovan</span>
            <span class="author-title mono-label">Interior Architect</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding-top: 50px;
    padding-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .about-p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .about-p strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .software-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .sw-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-visual-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-quote-box {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 28px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .quote-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .quote-author {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .author-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .author-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
